!! Multi-level glyphs (» and ›)

Both markers repeat (1-4 times) to encode a level. The level becomes a `wltc-l<N>` class on the emitted element.

!!! Level 1

» An angle paragraph at level 1.

!!! Level 2

»» Angle level 2.

!!! Level 3

»»» Angle level 3.

!!! Single, levels 1 and 2

› Single level 1.

›› Single level 2.

!!! Class chain on a leveled marker

»».indent.b Angle level 2 with indent + bold.